        [" ", "`text(Each morning)` my characters"],
        [" ", "\tgreet me with misty faces"],
        [" ", "willing, though chilled, to muster"],
        [" ", "\tfor another `text(day's)` progress"],
        ["5", "through the dazzling quicksand,"],
        [" ", "\tthe marsh of blank paper."],
        [" ", "With instant obedience"],
        [" ", "\tthey change clothes and mannerisms,"],
        [" ", "drop a speech impediment,"],
        ["10", "\tdevelop a motive backwards"],
        [" ", "to suit the deed that's done."],
        [" ", "\tThey extend skeletal arms"],
        [" ", "for the handcuffs of contrivance,"],
        [" ", "\tslog through docilely"],
        ["15", "maneuvers of coincidence,"],
        [" ", "\tlook toward me hopefully,"],
        [" ", "their general and quartermaster,"],
        [" ", "\tfor a clearer face, a bigger heart."],
        [" ", "I do what I can for them,"],
        ["20", "\tbut it is not enough."],
        [" ", "Forward is my order,"],
        [" ", "\tthough their bandages unravel"],
        [" ", "and some have no backbones"],
        [" ", "\tand some turn traitor"],
        ["25", "like heads with `text(two)` faces"],
        [" ", "\tand some fall forgotten"],
        [" ", "in the trenchwork of loose threads,"],
        [" ", "\tpoor puffs of cartoon flak."],
        [" ", "Forward. Believe me, I love them"],
        ["30", "\tthough I march them to finish them off."]
